&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;field field-type-text field-field-session-computer&quot;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;field-items&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;field-item odd&quot;&gt;
                      &lt;div class=&quot;field-label-inline-first&quot;&gt;
              Computer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
                    Puedo usar el PC de la sala (con Linux)        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/fieldset&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Where do you start when upgrading a website with an active community around it? How do you preserve the data for thousands of users and nodes? How do you move away from obsolete modules? How do you limit downtime to a few hours? These are common questions when upgrading websites from Drupal 5 to Drupal 6, and we&#039;ll see how to solve them and add new functionality on top of it!&lt;/p&gt;
